  "description": "The neorune command line for NeoRune, the C# modding SDK for Minecraft Dungeons II: read your mod's log (neorune log), explain crashes (neorune crash), check installed mods after game updates (neorune update), measure your mod (neorune perf), test its logic without the game (neorune test), tune it live (neorune tune), zip it for Nexus (neorune pack), see the bytecode your C# compiled to (neorune disasm), and, for SDK maintainers, dump the running game's API and diff it after game updates.",
